List pack and custom rules

Usage: shield rule list [OPTIONS]

Options:
      --project <PROJECT>              Select a project; otherwise discover the nearest enrolled ancestor
      --section <SECTION>              Page shared definitions, or one pack's invocation/command-set definitions [possible values: shared, invocations, command_sets]
      --json                           Print one JSON result; commands that change policy refuse JSON mode
      --pack-selector <PACK_SELECTOR>  Installed selector for invocation or command-set sections
      --cursor <CURSOR>                Continue with the previous result's opaque cursor
      --debug-log-dir <DEBUG_LOG_DIR>  Write private per-process diagnostics in this directory (also `SHIELD_DEBUG_LOG_DIR`)
      --limit <N>                      Maximum rows, from 1 to 100
      --no-debug-log                   Disable diagnostic logging, including automatic debug-build logs
      --cache-dir <CACHE_DIR>          Folder for this project's compiled policy plans, chosen at init or MCP setup
      --config <PATH>                  Shared configuration file; otherwise .shield/config.yml, then .config/shield/config.yml
  -h, --help                           Print help
